            <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-heading mb-1 text-center mt-3">Organic &amp; Local SEO</h3>
            <div class="text-base font-semibold mb-1 text-center">Regular: Local SEO Essentials</div>
            <span class="block text-sm bg-[#f56b2a] text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-full mb-3 font-semibold text-center"
              >Best for: Steady, Consistent Growth</span
            >
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#f56b2a] mb-1">
              $499<span class="text-base font-normal text-gray-500">/mo</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="text-body text-base mb-4 space-y-1 list-disc pl-5 w-full">
